* Three-level hierarchy with separate data-entry and review subgoals.
Goal: Submit an expense report
. Goal: Open expense report
.. Look at <expense report link>
.. Point to <expense report link>
.. Click <expense report link>
. Goal: Enter expense
.. Goal: Enter amount
... Look at <amount field>
... Point to <amount field>
... Click <amount field>
... Hands to keyboard
... Recall <amount>
... Type <amount>
.. Goal: Enter category
... Look at <category menu>
... Point to <category menu>
... Click <category menu>
... Search for <category>
... Point to <category>
... Click <category>
. Goal: Review and submit
.. Verify <amount> is correct
.. Verify <category> is correct
.. Look at <submit button>
.. Point to <submit button>
.. Click <submit button>
.. Verify report is submitted
